      "contentPath": "bedrockPatchNotes/db6cb09d335d0f1dbe1b296d1ff0fa8cd5a112f7b65a739baa72e1babced89c8.json",
      "id": "db6cb09d335d0f1dbe1b296d1ff0fa8cd5a112f7b65a739baa72e1babced89c8",
      "shortText": "又到了另一个 Minecraft：基岩版更新的时候了！此版本带来了大量的错误修复、游戏性改进、无障碍功能更新和面向创作者的技术增强。从船只被破坏所需的击打次数减少，到矿车重新回到",
      "needsTranslation": false
    },
    {
      "title": "26.30 - Chaos Cubed",
      "version": "26.30",
      "patchNoteType": "retail",
      "date": "2026-06-16T15:39:44.434Z",
      "image": {
        "title": "26.30.jpg",
        "url": "/v2/images/26.30.jpg"
      },
      "contentPath": "bedrockPatchNotes/f7d2d5f5380fb29c45850cfbb9862bf881b3ba66c41b4bbb8e1cd525b39595d6.json",
      "id": "f7d2d5f5380fb29c45850cfbb9862bf881b3ba66c41b4bbb8e1cd525b39595d6",
      "shortText": "Chaos Cubed 已登陆 Minecraft！在主世界中寻找鲜艳的硫磺泉，发现隐藏在下方的引人注目的洞穴生物群系。如果你胆子够大，可以在冒泡的硫磺池中畅游，用色彩斑斓的朱砂和硫磺进行建造，但最重要的是——揭开硫磺立",
      "needsTranslation": false
    },
    {
      "title": "Minecraft: Bedrock Edition 26.20 Changelog",
      "version": "26.20",
      "patchNoteType": "retail",
      "date": "2026-05-05T15:41:47.683Z",
      "image": {
        "title": "26.20.jpg",
        "url": "/v2/images/26.20.jpg"
      },
      "contentPath": "bedrockPatchNotes/836e028cbc075d74fafc83c998f151bca82287c30b0b74649bc2ef1e9d5c1665.json",
      "id": "836e028cbc075d74fafc83c998f151bca82287c30b0b74649bc2ef1e9d5c1665",
      "shortText": "今天我们为您带来了一个令人兴奋的版本——因为在测试中的混乱与方块之外，本版本还推出了隐藏式字幕！隐藏式字幕一直是备受期待的功能——现在您可以亲自体验，并可自定义",
      "needsTranslation": false
    },
    {
      "title": "26.10 - Tiny Takeover",
      "version": "26.10",
      "patchNoteType": "retail",
      "date": "2026-03-24T16:03:49.423Z",
      "image": {
        "title": "26.10.png",
        "url": "/v2/images/26.10.png"
      },
      "contentPath": "bedrockPatchNotes/a85e4952d3b347bbdf41dd131e838a6adfe4a3226a94aebcf71339a50b69ba81.json",
      "id": "a85e4952d3b347bbdf41dd131e838a6adfe4a3226a94aebcf71339a50b69ba81",
      "shortText": "无论您是否准备好，Tiny Takeover 更新已到来！幼年生物的新版本已席卷 Minecraft，在各生物群系和建筑中引发可爱过载。聆听融化心灵的声音，为您的宠物制作命名牌，并让幼崽永远保持年幼，使用",
      "needsTranslation": false
    },
    {
