      "patchNoteType": "retail",
      "date": "2026-02-10",
      "image": {
        "title": "26.0.jpg",
        "url": "/v2/images/26.0.jpg"
      },
      "contentPath": "bedrockPatchNotes/8d2342d74297decc49a0ea75d35410b7147876e46bbe4314ea9631e1f8e945a9.json",
      "id": "8d2342d74297decc49a0ea75d35410b7147876e46bbe4314ea9631e1f8e945a9",
      "shortText": "今天我不确定该从何说起——进入测试的幼年生物重新设计和可制作的命名牌？还是本版本是第一个采用我们新编号系统的版本？事实上，何必选择！在这个版本中我们进入了 26.0，而那",
      "needsTranslation": false
    },
    {
      "title": "1.21.130 - Mounts of Mayhem",
      "version": "1.21.130",
      "patchNoteType": "retail",
      "date": "2025-12-09",
      "image": {
        "title": "1.21.130.png",
        "url": "/v2/images/1.21.130.png"
      },
      "contentPath": "bedrockPatchNotes/75e38bfa18dddbddb4d3e2e75edcc9947d858a1e76ec413000616cd0195cb933.json",
      "id": "75e38bfa18dddbddb4d3e2e75edcc9947d858a1e76ec413000616cd0195cb933",
      "shortText": "今天 Mounts of Mayhem 冲入 Minecraft，带来了一把可挥舞的新武器、可驯服的坐骑、要面对的敌人，以及需要掌握的策略！挑战者们在烈日下、夜空下以及海洋深处等待——而每一次交锋都需要一个崭新",
      "needsTranslation": false
    },
    {
      "title": "1.21.120 Update",
