      "patchNoteType": "retail",
      "date": "2025-10-28T15:41:47.069Z",
      "image": {
        "title": "1.21.120.png",
        "url": "/v2/images/1.21.120.png"
      },
      "contentPath": "bedrockPatchNotes/afd40959c629647ba573474a43938611d0a195fe43509b8d2faaf53adb3653f6.json",
      "id": "afd40959c629647ba573474a43938611d0a195fe43509b8d2faaf53adb3653f6",
      "shortText": "当您与坐骑一起制造混乱时，我们一直在修复 bug 并实施重要的修复！除了添加动画灯笼纹理外，铜傀儡雕像现在放置在发光物品展示框中时会发光，并且与铜傀",
      "needsTranslation": null
    },
    {
      "title": "1.21.111 - The Copper Age",
      "version": "1.21.111",
      "patchNoteType": "retail",
      "date": "2025-09-30",
      "image": {
        "title": "1.21.111.jpg",
        "url": "/v2/images/1.21.111.jpg"
      },
      "contentPath": "bedrockPatchNotes/2fc70ab38598b311f5f1619f0a40c1ee0d0bee7289be3ad178eb6ff17f9f6ead.json",
      "id": "2fc70ab38598b311f5f1619f0a40c1ee0d0bee7289be3ad178eb6ff17f9f6ead",
      "shortText": "Minecraft 已进入铜器时代！用各种色调的铜来表达自我，将这种多用途金属转化为实用的工具、闪亮的盔甲、璀璨的光源、氧化的装饰、智能的储物装置，甚至是活泼的机械伙伴——被称为铜",
      "needsTranslation": null
    },
    {
      "title": "1.21.100 Update",
      "version": "1.21.100",
      "patchNoteType": "retail",
      "date": "2025-08-05",
      "image": {
        "title": "1.21.100_540.jpg",
        "url": "/v2/images/1.21.100540.jpg"
      },
      "contentPath": "bedrockPatchNotes/44f3ea0e8212a9132dca5b35889e9d3544477d97b301962adabd941c42bbe51b.json",
      "id": "44f3ea0e8212a9132dca5b35889e9d3544477d97b301962adabd941c42bbe51b",
      "shortText": "哐！哐！哐！如果您以为那是铜傀儡在尝试爵士健美操的声音，那就错了。实际上是我们深入挖掘实验性特性时，发现主世界是平坦的。等等，这也不对？但平坦世界",
      "needsTranslation": null
    },
    {
      "title": "1.21.90 - Chase the Skies",
      "version": "1.21.90",
      "patchNoteType": "retail",
      "date": "2025-06-17",
      "image": {
        "title": "1.21.90.jpg",
